# 从游戏本体派生的东西，一律不进仓库：游戏文件本身、由 default.xex 生成的代码、由它们构建出的二进制。

# --- 游戏文件 ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.xex
*.xexp
*.iso
*.bin
*.big
*.bun
*.viv
*.nfsp
*.nsp
*.xbe
*.wad
*.pssg
*.iff
assets/
game_root/
game_data/

# --- 由游戏生成 -------------------------------------------------------------
generated/
app/generated/
app/src/copias_literales/
app/src/*_spirv.h
app_*/

# --- 构建产物 ---------------------------------------------------------------
out/
build/
*.nro
*.nro.old
*.nacp
*.elf
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.so
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.log

# --- 运行时产物（日志 / 截图 / 探针导出）-------------------------------------
logs/
rex/logs/
capturas/
capturas_*/
capture*/
resuelta*.png
destino*.png
c49_*.raw
*.log
nba2k13_*.toml
!config/nba2k13.switch.toml

